---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Services"
  description="Pathtaker offers mental health intensives including mini intensives, daylong healing, outdoor therapy, and multi-day backpacking therapy trips."
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl text-brown-dark text-center mb-6">Heal Deeply. Live Wholeheartedly.</h1>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <img
        src="/images/IMG_4884.jpg"
        alt="Nature therapy setting"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
      Therapy that goes beyond the hour — for those ready to take the narrow path into the wild.
    </p>

    <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-brown/40 pl-6 italic text-lg leading-relaxed mb-12 text-brown">
      "At Pathtaker, we believe that true healing requires courage, presence, and space. Our mission:
      taking the narrow path into the wild, through adventure, in pursuit of wholeheartedness —
      reclaiming what has been lost."
    </blockquote>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-brown-dark mb-8">Our Services</h2>

    <div class="space-y-8 mb-14">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-body font-bold mb-2">➤ Mini Intensives (3–4 Hours)</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Deep, focused one-on-one sessions with a trauma-informed therapist. Ideal for trauma
          processing, transitions, and breakthroughs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-body font-bold mb-2">➤ Daylong Healing Intensives</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Includes a therapy session plus one of the following: yoga therapy, massage therapy, or
          spiritual advisory session.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-body font-bold mb-2">➤ Outdoor Intensives</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Nature-based therapy experiences — conducted in forests, trails, or other outdoor settings.
          Available as mini or full-day options.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-body font-bold mb-2">➤ 3–4 Day Backpacking Therapy Trips</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Immersive therapeutic backpacking in the wilderness. Includes daily individual and group
          therapy, somatic practices, and deep emotional processing — all in the healing power of
          nature.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-brown-dark mb-4">Our Approach: Science Meets Soul</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">All intensives are grounded in research-backed trauma modalities:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
      <li>Brainspotting (BSP)</li>
      <li>Somatic Experiencing (SE)</li>
      <li>Internal Family Systems (IFS)</li>
      <li>Emotionally Focused Therapy (EFT)</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="text-center text-lg font-bold">
      Start your journey today. Let's take the next step together.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
